{
  "name": "When does lavender bloom in Provence?",
  "parent_id": 230624347930176,
  "group_id": "7e54909c-84e2-4586-9c49-aa74e5efb8f1",
  "alternates": [],
  "created_at": "2026-10-15T07:18:10.449Z",
  "deleted_at": null,
  "sort_by_date": null,
  "tag_list": [],
  "updated_at": "2026-11-10T20:56:27.499Z",
  "published_at": "2026-11-10T20:56:27.466Z",
  "id": 230846834498216,
  "uuid": "e2f25301-d41f-4f7b-b2a1-52bbafb3c06d",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "d6cbed4d-ab74-4cf4-99d8-a9951f5e990f",
    "answer": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Most fields bloom from late June into July. The peak usually falls in the first half of July.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Harvest starts soon after, so earlier is safer if you want full colour. Timing shifts a little with each year's weather.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "question": "When does lavender bloom?",
    "component": "faq_item",
    "answer__i18n__de": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Die meisten Felder blühen von Ende Juni bis in den Juli. Der Höhepunkt liegt meist in der ersten Julihälfte.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Die Ernte beginnt bald danach. Wer die volle Farbenpracht sehen will, reist daher lieber etwas früher. Der Zeitpunkt verschiebt sich je nach Wetter des Jahres leicht.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "answer__i18n__es": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "La mayoría de los campos florecen desde finales de junio hasta julio. El punto álgido suele caer en la primera quincena de julio.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "La cosecha empieza poco después, así que es más seguro ir antes si quieres ver todo el color. Las fechas varían un poco según el tiempo de cada año.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "answer__i18n__fr": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "La plupart des champs fleurissent de fin juin à juillet. Le pic tombe en général dans la première quinzaine de juillet.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "La récolte commence peu après, mieux vaut donc venir plutôt tôt pour profiter de toutes les couleurs. Les dates varient un peu selon la météo de chaque année.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "question__i18n__de": "Wann blüht der Lavendel?",
    "question__i18n__es": "¿Cuándo florece la lavanda?",
    "question__i18n__fr": "Quand la lavande fleurit-elle ?"
  },
